The Contractor shall provide a fully equipped laboratory suitable for carrying out all testing requirements for the day-to-day operation of the Facility including, but not limited to:
- HRSG feed water;
- Steam;
- Potable water, including hydrocarbon content;
- Drain water, including hydrocarbon content;
- Fuel testing;
- Moisture analysis for lubricating and transformer oils.
