All primary sensors such as transducers, contacts, adapters etc. shall be provided along with all cabling and communications equipment. All circuits shall be brought to a telemetering interface point, which shall be installed in a communications room within the GIS substation. Connection from the telemetering interface point to the SCADA equipment will be by others. Details of the telemetering interface point shall be agreed with Offtaker' s LDC during the details design phase.
