- Active / Reactive power / energy measurements for each Transmission Line;
- Measurements of temperature and humidity of the site;
- Status indication of all 380 kV circuit breakers, isolators and earthing switches;
- Main Power Plant alarms;
- Protection trips for all generators, generator transformers, unit transformers, station
- transformers and HV Cables;
- Auxiliary power consumption of each unit;
- Total generated active/reactive power;
