Cables laid on trays shall be of adequate strength and size to carry in one layer (for power cables) or in several layers (I&C cables and small power cables), the weight, number and configuration required for each tray plus additional cables, not less than 25% by weight and dimensions, in excess of those installed. Cable tunnels shall not be used.
